I hope this message finds you doing well. I am excited to introduce you to Intel's enterprise software portfolio with a new brand to help showcase its capabilities, Intel® Tiber™. The Intel Tiber portfolio unites Intel's software, services, and solutions to help customers accelerate innovation, provide more trust from the cloud to the edge, affordable cloud computing, and more ROI from AI. Intel Tiber solutions are not just optimizing workloads but orchestrating and supporting multi-modal capabilities, removing complexities, all while being secure. These services are more than the brand; they provide customer success and support and can be combined with professional services from Intel or a partner.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
The Intel Tiber portfolio includes four product suites:&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />
<br />
1. <strong>Trust &amp; Security</strong>: From the cloud to the edge, keep your data and workloads safe and compliant.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />
<br />
2. <strong>AI</strong>: Unlock more ROI with a simpler way to build, deploy, and manage AI models on any infrastructure.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />
<br />
3. <strong>Cloud</strong>: Boost application efficiency with continuous, real-time cloud optimization for the data center.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />
<br />
4. <strong>Edge</strong>: Modular platform for network and edge transformation.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Learn more at <a href="intel.com/tiber">intel.com/tiber</a> , and feel free to share with other innovation stakeholders in your organization.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
If you are interested in how Intel Tiber can address your specific AI &amp; business challenges, let's schedule a meeting. Simply reply to this email to initiate the discussion.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
&nbsp;Thank you for considering Intel Tiber.&nbsp;<br />
